{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott, a young man from Manhattan, finally pops the question to his girlfriend... who promptly says &quot;no.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's so dejected that he accidentally drops the ring he used to propose into a storm drain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ring keeps falling deeper and deeper underground. It falls into the sewers, then further down into... a movie theater?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, is that a jet plane? Why are we in the Old West now? What are cowboys doing underground???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out that deep below Manhattan , there's an underground dungeon where America's past lives on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Scott be able to traverse it deep enough to find his ring?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore America's history... turned into a dungeon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weird dungeon is a collection of the culture and memories of decades past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The golden age of cinema, the space race, the Old West...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take a taste of America's past, UNDERGROUNDED will offer you a full-course dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what's your favorite decade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/f4dddd7ae4b805bd44fe5b0ba0fd2ae9.avif?t=1769489032\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Get through puzzles with a trusted ally!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think America's history is too much for one shy Manhattan boy (or for an inexperienced gamer) to tackle on his own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worry not! You have a great ally on your quest: a talkative, cheerful canary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a puzzle has got you stumped, listen to your bird friend. He might just have the hint you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/77cf3776591d7724c80308ba32c8f8b5.avif?t=1769489032\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get back what you've lost!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott isn't the only one who found his way into the underground dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of different people who have lost something are there to find it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them out and maybe, just maybe, that will help Scott's life change for the better as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies with retro games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right, I forgot to mention one thing. There are terrifying, powerful bosses waiting for you in the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't despair: Scott has a mysterious power. If he finds a retro game cabinet and plays it, strange things happen in the world around him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play several nostalgic homages to '80s arcade masterpieces to find a way to defeat those bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/49d6188d08f7ed4398a42a40c8b7802a.avif?t=1769489032\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3076910?t=1769489032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3076910?t=1769489032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769489032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769489032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3287790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott, a young man from Manhattan, finally pops the question to his girlfriend... who promptly says &quot;no.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's so dejected that he accidentally drops the ring he used to propose into a storm drain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ring keeps falling deeper and deeper underground. It falls into the sewers, then further down into... a movie theater?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, is that a jet plane? Why are we in the Old West now? What are cowboys doing underground???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out that deep below Manhattan , there's an underground dungeon where America's past lives on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Scott be able to traverse it deep enough to find his ring?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore America's history... turned into a dungeon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weird dungeon is a collection of the culture and memories of decades past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The golden age of cinema, the space race, the Old West...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take a taste of America's past, UNDERGROUNDED will offer you a full-course dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what's your favorite decade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/f4dddd7ae4b805bd44fe5b0ba0fd2ae9.avif?t=1769489032\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Get through puzzles with a trusted ally!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think America's history is too much for one shy Manhattan boy (or for an inexperienced gamer) to tackle on his own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worry not! You have a great ally on your quest: a talkative, cheerful canary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a puzzle has got you stumped, listen to your bird friend. He might just have the hint you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/77cf3776591d7724c80308ba32c8f8b5.avif?t=1769489032\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get back what you've lost!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott isn't the only one who found his way into the underground dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of different people who have lost something are there to find it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them out and maybe, just maybe, that will help Scott's life change for the better as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies with retro games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right, I forgot to mention one thing. There are terrifying, powerful bosses waiting for you in the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't despair: Scott has a mysterious power. If he finds a retro game cabinet and plays it, strange things happen in the world around him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play several nostalgic homages to '80s arcade masterpieces to find a way to defeat those bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/49d6188d08f7ed4398a42a40c8b7802a.avif?t=1769489032\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Game Studio Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/header.jpg?t=1769489032","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076910/727661/03ef58b3a2d57d1ad4c7af17893a83a8c14d906b/1750972905/dash_av1.mpd?t=1721437508","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076910/727661/03ef58b3a2d57d1ad4c7af17893a83a8c14d906b/1750972905/dash_h264.mpd?t=1721437508","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076910/727661/03ef58b3a2d57d1ad4c7af17893a83a8c14d906b/1750972905/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1721437508","id":257038751,"name":"\"UNDERGROUNDED\" 1st Trailer -1st Half- ENGLISH","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257038751/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1721437508"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076910/727634/d890ded3440804c249df47450cdeafa4830755e8/1750972904/dash_av1.mpd?t=1721437514","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076910/727634/d890ded3440804c249df47450cdeafa4830755e8/1750972904/dash_h264.mpd?t=1721437514","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3076910/727634/d890ded3440804c249df47450cdeafa4830755e8/1750972904/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1721437514","id":257038745,"name":"\"UNDERGROUNDED\" 1st Trailer -2nd Half- ENGLISH","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257038745/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1721437514"}],"name":"UNDERGROUNDED","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><